{title: Torna a Surriento (para Tuna)}
{key: Em}
{time: 3/4}
{meta: rhythm Vals}
{meta: source Tunabundel – Tuna Ciudad de Luz}

{comment: Intro}
| [Em] | [A] | [D] | [Gm] |
| [Dm] | [A] | [Dm] |

{start_of_verse: Couplet 1}
[Dm]Vide 'o mare quant'è [Dm]bello! [Gm/D]Spira tantu senti[Dm]mento,
[Bb]comme tu a chi tiene [Dm]mente, [A]ca scetato 'o faie sun[D]na'.
[F#m]Guarda, qua' chistu ciar[Em]dino, [A]siente, sie' sti sciurea[D]rance.
Nu prufummo accussì [Em]fino, [A]dinto 'o core se ne [D]va.
[F#m]E tu dice: "I' parto, ad[Em]dio!" [A]T'alluntane da stu [Bbm]core.
Da la terra de l'am[Dm/A]more, [A7]tiene 'o core 'e nun tur[D]na'?
[Dmaj7]Manunme las[Em]sa', [A7] nun darme stu tur[D]miento!
[Gm]Torna a Sur[Dm/A]riento, [A7]famme cam[Dm]pa'!
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Intermezzo}
| [Dm] | . | . | . |
| [Gm/D] | [Dm] | [Bb] | [Dm] |
| [A7] | [D] |

{start_of_verse: Couplet 2}
[F#m]Guarda gua chistu ciar[Em]dine [A]Siente sie sti sciurea[D]rance
nu profumoac cussi [Em]fine [A]dinto core se ne [D]va
[F#m]E tu dicei partea[Em]ddio! [A7]Tealluntane da stu [Bb]core
Da sta terra de la[Dm/A]mmore [A7]Tieneo core nun tur[D]na?
[Dmaj7]Ma nun me la[Em]ssa! [A7]nun darme stu tur[D]miento
[Gm]Tornea Sur[Dm/A]rien to [A7]Famme cam[Dm]pa!
[Dmaj7]Ma nun me la[Em]ssa! [A7]nun darme stu tur[D]miento
[Gm]Tornea Sur[Dm/A]rien to [A]Famme cam[D]pa[Dmaj7]!
{end_of_verse}
